Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 10:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] drm/mediatek: integrate MT6897 dual-pipe and firmware
 handover

Integrate multi-controller dual-pipe display, OVL runtime ownership and
firmware-gated translated handover. Abort a stuck CMDQ configuration on
CRTC disable; preserve the CPU-updated DisplayPort path.

